I get down from the bus.
This is a part of South Mumbai.
There is a lot of crowd on the street here.
I look around.
I remember the conductor's words.
"Madam, go straight towards the sea."
I walk straight.
But there are many people and cars ahead.
I see a road on the right.
I mistakenly turn right.
This road is very big.
There are only shops and offices here.
I go further ahead.
But I don't see water anywhere.
I walk away from the sea.
I lose my way.
Now I need help.
I stop in front of a small shop.
